      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 8991,
        "name": "真语秘匣",
        "desc": "黄金与玉石雕琢而成的角匣，传说曾供奉于蓝宝石之城图莱杜拉深处的神殿。",
        "iconUrl": "https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2025/10/20/a81d9e6d6b35935cfa6027c1d74d70c8_5519387986125030469.png",
        "displayStyle": "card",
        "menuId": 4
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 5151,
        "name": "沙中伟贤的对答",
        "desc": "象征炼金术荣耀的双蛇杖，因其地位特殊使用了特殊合金。刚度很高，重量很重，拿来打人也一定很疼。",
        "iconUrl": "https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2024/03/13/cc3e6b2a6e31846dff52115554a9bedd_7197352110243179180.png",
        "displayStyle": "card",
        "menuId": 4
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 3902,
        "name": "鹮穿之喙",
        "desc": "<p>以故事中的描述铸就的黄金之弓。若将它作为寻常武具使用，也可视为让纸上故事的一角在纸外的世界得到显现了吧。</p>",
        "iconUrl": "https://upload-static.hoyoverse.com/hoyolab-wiki/2023/06/05/47826599/3c33fbd1aeadf27dc00617c3f4d31c55_6071963423325105462.png",
